<title>ITALY: Italy records bop deficit in August.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop deficit in August.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 3.191 trillion lire deficit in August, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Aug 96	 July 96     Aug 95</p>
<p> Total		     -3,191		+4     -2,346</p>
<p>  -Year to date	 +21,385	 +24,558     +5,269</p>
<p> Capital movements    -13,499	  -5,250     -5,748</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -8,811	    +393     -4,036</p>
</text>
